# AgencyOS — Environment Variable Template
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in actual values.
# NEVER commit .env or .env.local to source control.

# No external API keys or environment variables are currently required
# by the application — it is a fully client-side static SPA.
#
# If you add Supabase, Firebase, or any backend service in the future,
# add the variable names below (leave values empty in this file):
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=
